Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 03:35:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] FaceUnlock: Fit enrollment to tablets

The enroll and try again screens were locked to portrait, and the enroll
preview was a fixed 240x320 box sized for the rotated preview on a
phone. On a tablet the rotated preview comes out landscape and was
squeezed into that box.

Show these screens in landscape, following the sensor between the two
landscape rotations, and size the preview view to the preview as shown,
inside a 320x320 area. Keeping the opening orientation is not enough:
Settings shows the face intro in the panel's natural portrait first.
A 180 degree turn does not restart enrollment.
---
 AndroidManifest.xml                           |  4 ++--
 res/layout/face_enroll.xml                    |  2 +-
 .../aospa/sense/activities/EnrollActivity.kt  |  3 +++
 .../sense/controller/FaceEnrollController.kt  |  8 ++++++++
 src/co/aospa/sense/view/CircleSurfaceView.kt  | 20 +++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 34 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/AndroidManifest.xml b/AndroidManifest.xml
index 4bcd227..44e9ee1 100644
--- a/AndroidManifest.xml
+++ b/AndroidManifest.xml
@@ -29,14 +29,14 @@
